<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica; text-size-adjust: auto;">Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span><br style="font-family: Helvetica; text-size-adjust: auto;"></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="text-size-adjust: auto;"><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><div><div><i style="">Congrats on moving forward with your passive income plan!<span class="Apple-converted-space" style="font-size: small;">&nbsp;</span></i><br></div><font size="2"><br></font></div><font size="2">Our next step is going to be assisting you through the entire closing process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><font size="2" style=""><font face="Helvetica">*&nbsp;You will receive&nbsp;an email from docusign with your contract documents.&nbsp; Please take time and review and direct any and all questions back to me so that I can help you get that back in within 3 days or it will expire and the property will be released.</font><span class="Apple-converted-space" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;">&nbsp;</span><br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2">*If you are financing in any way we will then make sure the executed contract gets over to the lender you will be using.<span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;">*After we receive your executed contract, you will be called<span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span><b>once a week</b><span class="Apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span>to let you know what next steps you will need to take.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2">This will include&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><ul><li><font size="2">Setting up insurance.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font size="2">Facilitating the closing process between the insurance provider, closing agent and lender.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font size="2">Making sure that you have all of the before and after pictures of the property.</font></li></ul></div></div><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;">Your contact person other than myself during this closing process will be:</font><br><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><br></font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><div dir="ltr" style=""><div style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-stretch: normal;"><font size="2"><span style="color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: georgia, serif;">Taylor Streitmatter&nbsp;</span><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-stretch: normal;"><font face="georgia, serif" color="#444444" size="2">Closing Department</font></div><div style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-stretch: normal;"><div style="font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="2">​P:&nbsp;<a href="tel:(901)%20505-0728" value="+19015050728" target="_blank">901-505-0728</a></font></div><div style="font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="2">F:&nbsp;<a href="tel:(901)%20751-7187" value="+19017517187" target="_blank">901-751-7187</a></font></div><div style="font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="2" style="">E:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:taylors@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank" style=""><span class="gmail-il">taylors@memphisinvest.com</span></a>​</font></div></div></div><div style=""><span style="border-collapse: separate;"><font color="#0000ff" face="tahoma, sans-serif"><font size="2"><br></font></font></span></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2">**&nbsp;<i><b>After closing&nbsp;</b></i>** You will be introduced to a customer service representative.&nbsp; They will be calling you weekly the first 4 weeks, then monthly as long as you are a client of ours.&nbsp; They will be your go-to person for any and all questions you may have regarding the management of your asset.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2">I am looking forward to assisting you in anyway I can throughout the entire process as well. Please feel free to reach out to me at anytime.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font style=""><font size="2" style=""><i style="">To Your Success-&nbsp;</i></font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><font style=""><font size="2" style=""><i style=""><br></i></font></font></div></div></div></div><div class="gmail-m_2635947190694101151gmail-m_7598550169318453920m_4963374381516091073m_6810253690898035280m_-8957148499335290148gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;"><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><div dir="ltr" style=""><table border="0"><tbody><tr><td width="200px"><font size="2"><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);"><b>Ashley Claunch</b><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136);"></span></span><br><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);"><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136);"><i>Sr.Portfolio Advisor</i></span><i><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136);">,<br><a href="http://memphisinvest.com/">MemphisInvest.c</a></span></i></span><span style="color: rgb(128, 128, 128);"><i><span style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136);"><a href="http://memphisinvest.com/">om</a></span></i><